The Intelligent Budget Tracker: An AI-powered personal finance manager that automatically reads SMS alerts (with user permission) to track spending and categorizes your kharcha without manual entry.

The Micro-Budgeting App: A hyper-simplified daily expense tracker designed for students, freelancers, or blue-collar workers who just want to know, "How much money do I have left to spend today?"
